nd","r":"management","s":"Michael Intrator","x":"We convert scarce AI infrastructure into revenue-generating AI cloud capacity quickly, reliably and profitably.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/coreweave-crwv-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CRWV 2026 Q1","e":"crwv","d":"2026-05-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael Intrator","x":"And so we've done a really good job of understanding what the components and electricity costs are going to be, we have it structured so that it is effectively passed through when we enter into the contract once again, to ensure that we're able to hit our targeted margins on a unit basis.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/coreweave-crwv-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CRWV 2026 Q1","e":"crwv","d":"2026-05-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Mark Murphy","x":"What holds you back from just passing through that revenue upside into the full year revenue guidance because, I mean, in some sense, technically will reduce our rest of year revenue forecast a little.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/coreweave-crwv-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CRWV 2026 Q1","e":"crwv","d":"2026-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Nitin Agrawal","x":"The strength of our Q1 results, disciplined execution and continued momentum we are seeing across our customer base gives us confidence in reaffirming our full year guidance of $12 billion to $13 billion of revenue and $900 million to $1.1 billion of adjusted operating income.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/coreweave-crwv-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CRWV 2026 Q1","e":"crwv","d":"2026-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Nitin Agrawal","x":"We are reaffirming our full year guidance, including full year revenue, full year adjusted operating income and that we will exit the year with low double-digit adjusted operating income margin.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/08/coreweave-crwv-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CRWV 2026 Q2","e":"crwv","d":"2026-08-11","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Nitin Agrawal","x":"The scale of our AI products and services beyond GPUs also continues to ramp significantly as customers consolidate spend with us.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/18/coreweave-crwv-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CRWV 2026 Q2","e":"crwv","d":"2026-08-11","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Nitin Agrawal","x":"In a market where new capacity is supply constrained and costs are rising, AI cloud infrastructure and production is a scarce, valuable asset.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/18/coreweave-crwv-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CRWV 2026 Q2","e":"crwv","d":"2026-08-11","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Nitin Agrawal","x":"We are also passing through component price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/18/coreweave-crwv-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CRWV 2026 Q2","e":"crwv","d":"2026-08-11","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jyhhaw Liu","x":"So my first question is, it sounds like there's upward pressure to pricing across multiple vectors, including the higher value you provide to your customers, the pass-through of higher component costs and the recontracting opportunity coming up.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/18/coreweave-crwv-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CRWV 2026 Q3","e":"crwv","d":"2026-11-10","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Michael Intrator","x":"Powering these promising ideas requires the tools to build and deploy AI on reliable compute at attractive economics.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/10/coreweave-crwv-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CRWV 2026 Q3","e":"crwv","d":"2026-11-10","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Michael Intrator","x":"With high quality investment grade customers at the tight end of that range and AI labs towards the wide end.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/10/coreweave-crwv-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CRWV 2026 Q3","e":"crwv","d":"2026-11-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Nitin Agrawal","x":"You know, across the industry, what we are seeing that demand is transforming into pricing power.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/10/coreweave-crwv-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CRWV 2026 Q3","e":"crwv","d":"2026-11-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Nitin Agrawal","x":"So we are seeing that translate that demand translate into pricing power and our ability to kind of extract margin for our premium product infrastructure and cloud products.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/10/coreweave-crwv-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CRWV 2026 Q3","e":"crwv","d":"2026-11-10","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Nitin Agrawal","x":"And, Benjamin, to answer your second question around, like, you know, the contribution around what drove the performance this quarter as well as our raised guidance for next quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/10/coreweave-crwv-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CRWV 2026 Q3","e":"crwv","d":"2026-11-10","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Nitin Agrawal","x":"All 3 vectors contributed to this quarter as well as expected to contribute further as we raised our guidance for Q4 as well.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/10/coreweave-crwv-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[64,1,8472,0,0,0,7297,879],[65,1,8190,0,0,0,6953,1036],[66,1,8547,0,0,0,2564,5553],[67,1,9057,0,0,0,7792,876]],"cinema":[[64,1,8472,0,0,0,7297,879],[65,1,8190,0,0,0,6953,1036],[66,1,8547,0,0,0,2564,5553],[67,1,9057,0,0,0,7792,876]],"imax